{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433","id":2436418906,"node_id":"I_kwDOAAe_f86ROM1a","number":111433,"title":"Reallocation of .watches shards resets interval schedule watches","user":{"login":"masseyke","id":453603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzYwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/453603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke","html_url":"https://github.com/masseyke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masseyke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":912845062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5MTI4NDUwNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Distributed/Watcher","name":":Distributed/Watcher","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":""},{"id":1967496097,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2MDk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Data%20Management%20(obsolete)","name":"Team:Data Management (obsolete)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"DO NOT USE. This team no longer exists."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-07-29T21:32:51Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T14:27:24Z","closed_at":"2024-10-22T14:27:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If I create a watch on a 3-node cluster with an interval schedule, like\r\n```\r\ncurl -X PUT \"localhost:9200/_watcher/watch/log_error_watch?pretty\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'\r\n{\r\n  \"trigger\" : {\r\n    \"schedule\" : { \"interval\" : \"1h\" } \r\n  },\r\n  \"input\" : {\r\n    \"search\" : {\r\n      \"request\" : {\r\n        \"indices\" : [ \"logs\" ],\r\n        \"body\" : {\r\n          \"query\" : {\r\n            \"match\" : { \"message\": \"error\" }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n'\r\n```\r\nAnd then I move a .watches shard:\r\n```\r\ncurl -X POST \"localhost:9200/_cluster/reroute?metric=none&pretty\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'\r\n{\r\n  \"commands\": [\r\n    {                      \r\n      \"move\": {\r\n        \"index\": \".watches\", \"shard\": 0,\r\n        \"from_node\": \"runTask-2\", \"to_node\": \"runTask-1\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n'\r\n```\r\nThen the trigger interval starts over -- it will be one hour from the time I moved the shard. This especially becomes a problem if the interval is large because shards are more likely to get moved around by the allocator in more recent versions of Elasticsearch. For example if a 4-hour interval is configured, and .watches shards get moved on average a couple of times per hour, it could be days before the watch is ever executed.","closed_by":{"login":"lukewhiting","id":897881,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5Nzg4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/897881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting","html_url":"https://github.com/lukewhiting","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukewhiting/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/111433/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}